565 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 438 0 R
/E (During our field analysis we mapped the fuel collection zones and the scoring targets. One of the most relevant elements was the bump: an obstacle the robot must cross without getting stuck.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
566 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 438 0 R
/E (This led us to keep the tank-style \(KitBot\) drivetrain, which offers stability and the ability to cross this kind of obstacle without losing control. That decision let us focus on increasing fuel storage capacity without risking mobility on the field.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
