/Pg 56 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
1002 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 479 0 R
/E (In the third iteration \(V3\), we refined the complete system by integrating these changes, which clearly improved the robot's overall performance. Jams dropped significantly, shooting speed increased and ball trajectories became more consistent.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1003 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 479 0 R
/E (As a result, the robot went from an unstable system with constant flow losses to a mechanism that shoots continuously and under control, fully aligned with our strategy of maximizing points through volume and speed.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
