/T (Fuel entered the shooter misaligned, causing jams and inconsistent shots. Balls also tended to build up on the intake base, interrupting the flow inside the robot. On top of that, a code error made the upper intake and feeder shafts spin in opposite directions, breaking system synchronization.)
/E (Fuel entered the shooter misaligned, causing jams and inconsistent shots. Balls also tended to build up on the intake base, interrupting the flow inside the robot. On top of that, a code error made the upper intake and feeder shafts spin in opposite directions, breaking system synchronization.)
/Pg 56 0 R
/K [6]
>>
