/P 485 0 R
/E (If we continued developing this robot, we would focus on further optimizing the current system rather than changing the design completely.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1051 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 485 0 R
/E (We would refine ball handling by tuning compression and alignment more precisely, to increase shot consistency in different game conditions. We would also improve the extendable hopper, aiming for a more space-efficient design with better internal flow control.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1052 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 485 0 R
/E (In programming, a key improvement would be more precise speed control and synchronization between subsystems, making better use of sensor data so the robot can adapt during the match.)
/Pg 62 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
1053 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
